        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦈 Sammy the Sharky</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you outswim the sea’s hungriest predator?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Sammy the Sharky</i> — a fast-paced underwater survival game where you’ll need lightning reflexes and sharp strategy to keep your school of fish alive! Move fish around to dodge the ever-hungry Sammy, collect points, and compete with players worldwide for the top spot on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag, dodge, and survive:</strong> Control multiple fish at once and weave through the chaos to avoid being eaten!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain combos for big points:</strong> Keep your fish alive longer to multiply your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete globally:</strong> Climb the ranks on the world leaderboard — only the most skilled survive the sharky waters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay anyone can jump into.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty the longer you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards to show off your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute  underwater visual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 Can You Outsmart Sammy?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second you survive earns points — but one wrong move and it’s fish food! Dive in, stay calm, and see if you have what it takes to swim to the top. It's That Shark Game</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦈 Sammy the Sharky</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you outswim the sea’s hungriest predator?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Sammy the Sharky</i> — a fast-paced underwater survival game where you’ll need lightning reflexes and sharp strategy to keep your school of fish alive! Move fish around to dodge the ever-hungry Sammy, collect points, and compete with players worldwide for the top spot on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag, dodge, and survive:</strong> Control multiple fish at once and weave through the chaos to avoid being eaten!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain combos for big points:</strong> Keep your fish alive longer to multiply your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete globally:</strong> Climb the ranks on the world leaderboard — only the most skilled survive the sharky waters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay anyone can jump into.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty the longer you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards to show off your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute  underwater visual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 Can You Outsmart Sammy?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second you survive earns points — but one wrong move and it’s fish food! Dive in, stay calm, and see if you have what it takes to swim to the top. It's That Shark Game</p>",
